    "modified": true,
    "numerical_realization": "Existing default-off cb1_stable_pq uses the original ST2084 operator/constants/domain. Its shared inverse helper uses a fixed general expm1 P5(z/16) seed and four deficit doublings, an explicitly bounded primitive approximation, not an exact identity or fitted curve. Original nonpositive-to-zero behavior is retained with positive-only log; negative super-white deficits and the final power remain. Forward emission and native/Basic are unchanged.",
    "interfaces": [
      "pl_render_params.min_fbo_precision",
      "pl_render_params.cb1_nearest_identity (default off, matched policy ABI required)",
      "pl_color_map_params.cb1_fp32_tone_lut (default off, matched policy ABI required)",
      "pl_render_params.cb1_stable_pq and pl_shader_params.cb1_stable_pq (default off)",
      "pl_dispatch_mark_cb1_stable_pq (matched renderer/shader/dispatch ABI required)",
      "pl_render_params.cb1_fp32_scaler_lut and pl_sample_filter_params.cb1_fp32_lut (default off)",
      "pl_render_params.cb1_hook_color_space (default off, matched renderer ABI; effective hook domain)",
      "pl_sample_filter_cb1_fp32_lut_format (matched orthogonal sampler format ABI)",
      "Custom shader prelude extension ordering and FP32 reconstruction changes",
      "pl_render_params.cb1_dovi_transport and cb1_exact_scaler_cache (default off)",
      "pl_sample_filter_params.cb1_exact_lut_cache (default off)",
      "pl_shader_dovi_reconstruct and pl_render_image_cb1_active_rows (explicit CB1 transport only)",
      "pl_render_params.cb1_processing, pl_shader_dovi_reconstruct_ex and pl_cb1_processing_abi (default null, matched processing version/layout)",
      "pl_render_params.cb1_fast_chroma and pl_cb1_chroma_filter_abi (default off, input chroma only, matched renderer ABI)",
      "pl_render_params.cb1_dovi_linear, pl_color_decode_args.cb1_dovi_linear and CM2.9 neutral mapping (default off, matched processing ABI 10)",
      "pl_render_params.cb1_fel_filter and pl_cb1_fel_filter_abi (generation 2, default zero, EL-only bilinear/reference selector)",
      "pl_dovi_metadata.cb1_native_bounds and cb1_nlq_max (default off, matched processing ABI 10)",
      "pl_render_params.cb1_dovi_reference (default null, contract 1, matched processing ABI 10)",
      "pl_color_map_args.cb1_tone_map (Expert opt-in; PL_CB1_EXPERT_TONE_ABI; rebuild all consumers)"
    ]
  },
